{"id":"fce963a0c22b921d","group":"17","path":"17/17-prop-generated-filter.md","title":"Generated Filter and Properness","display":"prop-generated-filter — Generated Filter and Properness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-prop-generated-filter","aliases":["17-prop-generated-filter"],"display":"prop-generated-filter — Generated Filter and Properness","depends_on":["[[17-df-generated-filter]]","[[17-df-filter]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"Proposition 4.1.1","source_pages_print":[212],"source_pages_djvu":[228],"source_verification":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; finite-family variant"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-prop-generated-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-prop-generated-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-generated-filter — Generated Filter and Properness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5deae0a21cc8b810\" href=\"?note=5deae0a21cc8b810\" title=\"17-df-generated-filter\">17-df-generated-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Proposition 4.1.1"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>228</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; finite-family variant"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)\">\\(D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5deae0a21cc8b810\" href=\"?note=5deae0a21cc8b810\" title=\"17-df-generated-filter\">17-df-generated-filter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Filter}_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FIP}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{FIP}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5deae0a21cc8b810\" href=\"?note=5deae0a21cc8b810\" title=\"17-df-generated-filter\">17-df-generated-filter</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{Filter}_I(D)\\land E\\subseteq D,\\\\\n&amp;D=\\left\\{X\\subseteq I:\\exists e\\subseteq E\\;\n\\left(|e|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall Y\\in e\\;i\\in Y)\\to i\\in X\\bigr)\\right)\\right\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{FIP}_I(E).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{Filter}_I(D)\\land E\\subseteq D,\\\\\n&amp;D=\\left\\{X\\subseteq I:\\exists e\\subseteq E\\;\n\\left(|e|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall Y\\in e\\;i\\in Y)\\to i\\in X\\bigr)\\right)\\right\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{FIP}_I(E).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书命题4.1.1，印刷 p.212（DjVu 228），陈述和所给证明均已核对。空有限族的共同元素条件为全体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，对应书中单列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=I\">\\(X=I\\)</span> 分支。右侧显式族包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，对交集和向上包含封闭，并包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>；任意包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的滤子都包含它，故它正是交定义的生成滤子。空集属于该族恰当某个有限子族没有共同元素；据滤子真性与排除空集的等价，得到最后一式。空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 给平凡滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{I\\}\">\\(\\{I\\}\\)</span>，含空集的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 给非真滤子，均与式子相符。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-generated-filter","status":"resolved","id":"5deae0a21cc8b810","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-generated-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-generated-filter","status":"resolved","id":"5deae0a21cc8b810","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$，$D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)$，见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$、$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$，$D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)$，见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$、$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-generated-filter","status":"resolved","id":"5deae0a21cc8b810","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$，$D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)$，见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$、$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FIP}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{Filter}_I(D)\\land E\\subseteq D,\\\\\n&D=\\left\\{X\\subseteq I:\\exists e\\subseteq E\\;\n\\left(|e|<\\aleph_0\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall Y\\in e\\;i\\in Y)\\to i\\in X\\bigr)\\right)\\right\\},\\\\\n&\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{FIP}_I(E).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"X=I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\{I\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":1736,"backlinks":[{"id":"421b1aea26ad8bcb","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书推论4.1.11，印刷 pp.219–220（DjVu 235–236），陈述及证明均已核对。对每个 $\\sigma\\in T$，令 $X_\\sigma=\\{s\\in I:\\sigma\\in s\\}$。任意有限个 $X_\\sigma$ 的交包含由这些句子组成的有限集，因此该族有有限交性质；[[17-prop-generated-filter]] 给真生成滤子，[[17-thm-ultrafilter-extension]] 给含它的超滤子。每个 $X_\\sigma$ 包含于 $\\{s:\\mathfrak A_s\\models\\sigma\\}$，所以该真值集合在超滤子中，由 Łoś 定理的句子情形，超积满足每个 $\\sigma\\in T$。$T=\\varnothing$ 时 $I=\\{\\varnothing\\}$，证明仍成立。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-prop-finite-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-prop-finite-model-saturation]]\n[[17-prop-formula-cardinality]]\n[[17-prop-generated-filter]]"}],"outgoing":["5deae0a21cc8b810","50a46bce013b2772"]}